  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WiPSU - Supporting Women in Politics Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women in Politics Support Unit (WiPSU),  engages and supports cross-political women in elected public and political office to facilitate the broader women&#x2019;s right movement goals as captured in the Mission of the organisation to ensure society in which women exercise and enjoy their human rights and participate as equals in all political processes with full citizenship rights.</narrative>
  </description>
